        <li><strong>Refunds:</strong> Except where mandated by local consumer protection laws (such as the Brazilian CDC), all subscription fees and credit purchases are non-refundable.</li>
        <li><strong>Taxes:</strong> Fees are exclusive of all taxes, levies, or duties. You are responsible for paying all applicable taxes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY & BRAND DNA</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Your Brand DNA:</strong> You retain 100% ownership of the strategic data, history, and positioning you input into the 12-block Brand DNA map. We claim no ownership over your brand's essence.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>AI-Generated Output:</strong> Subject to your compliance with these Terms, CopyMonster assigns to you all rights to the specific copy and campaigns generated by the AI Agents for your brand.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>CopyMonster IP:</strong> The Intelligence Engine, Agent architectures, Market Radar algorithms, and platform UI remain the exclusive property of CopyMonster. The "Open Core" components are governed by the MIT License.
      </p>

      <h2>5. PROHIBITED USES</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to: (a) reverse engineer the AI Agents or system prompts; (b) use the Services to generate spam, malicious code, or illegal content; (c) scrape the platform; (d) use the AI-Generated Output to train competing AI models.
      </p>

