      <p>
        THE SERVICES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS". COPYMONSTER DOES NOT GUARANTEE SPECIFIC MARKETING RESULTS, CONVERSIONS, OR REVENUE. AI MODELS MAY PRODUCE INACCURACIES. YOU ARE SOLELY RESPONSIBLE FOR REVIEWING AND ENSURING THE LEGAL COMPLIANCE OF ALL AI-GENERATED COPY BEFORE PUBLICATION. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, COPYMONSTER'S TOTAL LIABILITY SHALL NOT EXCEED THE AMOUNT YOU PAID US IN THE SIX (6) MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM, OR $100 USD, WHICHEVER IS GREATER.
      </p>

      <h2>7. DISPUTE RESOLUTION & GOVERNING LAW</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Global Users:</strong> Disputes shall be resolved via binding arbitration administered by the International Chamber of Commerce (ICC) in São Paulo, Brazil, in the English language. Class action waivers apply.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Brazilian Consumers:</strong> Governed by the laws of Brazil, specifically the Consumer Defense Code (CDC) and LGPD. Disputes will be resolved in the courts of the consumer's domicile.
